cmu-job-name-pathogen-bloodburster = Bloodburster
cmu-job-description-pathogen-bloodburster = A tiny sharp-clawed terror that just tore its way out of a living host. Evolve quickly and join your sisters.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-sprinter = Sprinter
cmu-job-description-pathogen-sprinter = A fast four-legged terror. Evolve quickly into a Neomorph or Blight.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-neomorph = Neomorph
cmu-job-description-pathogen-neomorph = A sleek, fast alien with sharp claws. Slow floored targets and finish them with a headbite.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-blight = Blight
cmu-job-description-pathogen-blight = A stealthy hunter. Use invisibility to ambush prey; your cloak breaks when you attack.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-conditor = Conditor
cmu-job-description-pathogen-conditor = The shaper and cultivator of the Confluence. Build structures and spit toxins.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-brute = Brute
cmu-job-description-pathogen-brute = A lumbering tank. Your strikes cleave nearby targets and slow them.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-venator = Venator
cmu-job-description-pathogen-venator = A wandering ball of death. Pull prey with your impale and devastate lines of enemies.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-harbinger = Harbinger
cmu-job-description-pathogen-harbinger = Doom made flesh. Spin through enemies with Cyclone and inject mycotoxin into the dead.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-popper = Popper
cmu-job-description-pathogen-popper = A crawling bag of spores. Place spore sacs and infect hosts. Your death releases a spore cloud.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-aberration = Aberration
cmu-job-description-pathogen-aberration = A Yautja-Pathogen hybrid. You are an abomination to both races — overwhelm all opposition with raw power.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-matriarch = Matriarch
cmu-job-description-pathogen-matriarch = Nothing will survive. Lead the Confluence to victory.
cmu-xeno-death-matriarch = Matriarch has fallen! Vengeance!

cmu-job-name-pathogen-overmind = Overmind
cmu-job-description-pathogen-overmind = The mind of the Confluence. Step onto a Blight Core to merge with it and guide your sisters to victory.
cmu-xeno-death-overmind = Our Overmind has died! Vengeance! Get to the Blight Core to become a new Overmind, for the Confluence!
cmu-new-overmind = New Overmind has risen to lead the Confluence, rejoice!
cmu14-blight-core-destroyed-overmind-died = The Blight Core has been destroyed! The Overmind, severed from its anchor, collapses. You feel a deep, numbing weakness spread through the mycelium.
cmu14-blight-core-destroyed-no-overmind = The Blight Core has been destroyed! The mycelium recoils in pain.
cmu14-blight-core-under-attack = The Blight Core is under attack!
cmu14-overmind-no-core-initial = The Overmind has awakened, but senses no Blight Core! A core must be constructed within 5 minutes or the Overmind will perish.
cmu14-overmind-no-core-warning-2min = The Overmind grows weak - no Blight Core binds it to this world. 2 minutes remain.
cmu14-overmind-no-core-warning-1min = The Overmind is fading. Only 1 minute remains before it is lost without a Blight Core.
cmu14-overmind-no-core-died = The Overmind, unbound and adrift, dissolves. The absence of a Blight Core has claimed it.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-haze = Haze
cmu-job-description-pathogen-haze = A supportive strain of the Confluence, tending wounds and spreading spores in equal measure.

cmu-job-name-pathogen-root = root
cmu-job-description-pathogen-root = A huge, looming beast of the Confluence, wreathed in writhing tentacles.